('60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000614', '50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', 'simple', 'mcq', 'What is UIKit?', '["A layout framework", "The classic imperative UI framework for iOS", "A database system", "A cloud platform"]', 'The classic imperative UI framework for iOS', 'UIKit provides the fundamental building blocks for creating iOS applications before SwiftUI.', 'active'),
('60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000615', '50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', 'simple', 'mcq', 'What is Core Data used for?', '["Networking", "Persistent data storage", "UI animation", "Image processing"]', 'Persistent data storage', 'Core Data is Apple''s framework for managing the model layer of an application, including persistence.', 'active'),
('60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000616', '50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', 'simple', 'mcq', 'What does Auto Layout do?', '["Animates views", "Calculates view sizes and positions based on constraints", "Handles database migrations", "Compresses images"]', 'Calculates view sizes and positions based on constraints', 'Auto Layout dynamically adjusts the user interface based on constraints you define.', 'active'),
