('60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000618', '50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', 'intermediate', 'mcq', 'What is an NSFetchedResultsController?', '["A view controller", "An object that manages the results of a Core Data fetch request", "A network manager", "A database driver"]', 'An object that manages the results of a Core Data fetch request', 'It efficiently manages and provides Core Data results to a table or collection view.', 'active'),
('60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000619', '50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', 'intermediate', 'mcq', 'What is "View Lifecycle" in UIKit?', '["The process of app installation", "The sequence of events when a view appears and disappears", "Compiling Xib files", "Scaling images"]', 'The sequence of events when a view appears and disappears', 'View lifecycle includes methods like viewDidLoad, viewWillAppear, etc.', 'active'),
('60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000620', '50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', 'intermediate', 'mcq', 'What is the purpose of a Delegate in UIKit?', '["To define private variables", "To handle specific events or provide data on behalf of another object", "To encrypt data", "To manage memory"]', 'To handle specific events or provide data on behalf of another object', 'Delegation is a design pattern where one object acts on behalf of another.', 'active'),
('60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000621', '50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', 'intermediate', 'code_mcq', 'How do you perform a fetch in Core Data?', '["CoreData.fetch(entity)", "let request = NSFetchRequest<Entity>(entityName: \"Entity\"); context.fetch(request)", "DB.query(\"SELECT * FROM Entity\")", "context.selectAll()"]', 'let request = NSFetchRequest<Entity>(entityName: "Entity"); context.fetch(request)', 'Fetch requests define the criteria for retrieving data from the persistent store.', 'active'),
