('60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000645', '50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000036', 'intermediate', 'mcq', 'What is the purpose of a Content Provider?', '["To manage application data and share it with other applications", "To display images", "To handle user clicks", "To compile the app"]', 'To manage application data and share it with other applications', 'Content Providers manage access to a structured set of data, offering security and encapsulation.', 'active'),
